WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 6.5 · MEAL: Monitoring, Evaluation, Accountability & Learning
Data collection, ethics and data quality

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Collect data ethically from the first day, using the simplest method you can keep up.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Ask for informed consent and collect only what you need.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Check the data protection rules where you work.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Test every tool with a few people before your pilot.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You draft your data collection plan and quality checks.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
